{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"華嚴經十地品校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"一.是書校歷二週.一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"二.譯校凡用六本。（一）梵文本十地經.〈缺各地文末重頌〉校註略稱梵本。（二）西晉竺","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"法護譯漸備一切智德經.略稱法護本。（三）姚秦鳩摩羅什譯十住經．略稱秦本。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"（四）東晉佛陀跋陀羅譯大方廣佛華嚴經十地品．略稱晉本。（五）唐尸羅達摩","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"譯佛說十地經.略稱尸羅本。（六）元魏菩提流支等譯十地經論牒文.略稱魏本。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"論文.略稱爲釋。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"三.譯校凡有四例。（一）各本品目文句歧異者．譯要註出曰．某本雲雲。（二）各本文","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"義較暢者．擇要註出曰.勘某本意雲雲。（三）因對勘各本而見今譯文義未愜者.","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"則並註按語曰．今譯雲雲。（四）又今譯名語應行訂正者.亦爲註出曰.勘某本此","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"語應譯雲雲。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"四.刻校用南宋刻爲底本.對勘麗刻訂正文字.附註曰.原刻雲雲.依麗刻雲雲。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"五.今刊頌文悉依尸羅本釐正.註出序數.分頌排列。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"六.校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"（一）梵本十地經．Das/abhu^mika-su^tra.蘭都氏J.Rahder.校刊本.一九二","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"六年.巴黎版。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"（二）法護本漸備一切智德經.日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"（三）秦本十住經．同上。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"（四）晉本大方廣佛華嚴經十地品．同上。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"（五）尸羅本佛說十地經.同上。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"（六）魏本十地經論.金陵刻經處刊本。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"（七）本書南宋刻麗刻.悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本之","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"校註。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_46_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_46","text":"第0758頁圖像********************","sortOrder":25}],"overrides":{}}